nt%22%3A720%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1191%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A18%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1730880309572\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/50494840/97e0bc6f3d029112ff73f6ca29cd26d3_5116393235211988813.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">288</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">24</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">由旧文明第十二律者核心制成的神之键，主掌“侵蚀”的力量，可以投影使用者的意识并自如操纵。其使用方式尚未解析完整···</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">御魂示现</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:40][冷却:50秒]地藏御魂【召唤物】出场协助角色作战，持续40秒，御魂出场时会对大范围内敌人造成300%攻击力的物理伤害并将其浮空。御魂还有以下攻击方式：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">挥砍攻击，造成100%攻击力的物理伤害</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">突刺攻击，造成200%攻击力的物理伤害并击飞敌人</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">下劈攻击，造成100%攻击力的物理伤害并浮空敌人</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">无明</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色对浮空敌人造成的全伤害提高32%</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">侵蚀之键</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">在联机Raid关卡中，角色造成的物理伤害提高15%。使用武器技能时，造成的物理伤害提高30%，持续10.0秒</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">拓境战幕</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">通过拓境战幕玩法获取<span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(24,144,255,1)&quot;&gt;神之键领取计数规则：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;·每获得一期活动中的6个挑战之星即可从以下列表中自选一件未获得过的神之键领取：&lt;br&gt;「天火圣裁」/「地藏御魂 」/「太虚之握」/「 天火大剑 」/「 伊甸之星」&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;·领取次数可以累计，不会每周清空&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;·领取次数最大不超过列表中未获得的神之键数量&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;·此页面内所有神之键领取完成后，此页面入口将会关闭&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">联机模式</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><s>通关联机关卡天守阁获取</s></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <thead><tr><th>突破等级</th> <th colspan=\"5\">所需材料</th></tr></thead> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">30</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">相转移镜面</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*6</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">35</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1191/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">魂蚀玉</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*220</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">相转移镜面</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*7</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">40</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1191/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">魂蚀玉</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*330</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">相转移镜面</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*15</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">45</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1191/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">魂蚀玉</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*720</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">相转移镜面</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*18</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><div class=\"mhy-popover-